Use synthetic football contexts and scores only, under the existing isolated Python3.12.2/NumPy1.26.4/SciPy1.13.1 runtime. One bounded unit suite must finish within120seconds and2048MiB, with no historical artifact load. Root-authored tests should independently check hand-computed one-game and batch increments; original nine-setting/eleven-variant diagonal equivalence across2019/2020/2021 and delayed delivery; common retention and2020 weighting; noS/noP versus O/D masking; preservation of each original pre-noise expectation; future/duplicate/missing/changed-context refusal; and absorbing failure. A separate reviewer inspects exact source and qualification before broader integration.

The suite may exercise the pure model's synthetic state updates. Passing it establishes numerical/temporal behavior only. Historical selection, input/mapper/control authentication, new-family distribution scoring,18-contrast inference and8-cell calibration, full integration qualification, a fixed cost pilot and the one new replay require a separately frozen RF-02F protocol and independent pre-fit acceptance. No automatic restart of any historical attempt is authorized.

## Decision

Retain the additive unit only if it matches the original tied path exactly and passes independent mathematical and temporal challenges. Reconstruct or remove it on a discrepancy. Measure suite wall time and peak RSS, including setup; do not call the design a compute speedup before equivalent-workload measurement. Keep all work and research details private.
